# Machine-local agent instructions

Seeded by `install.sh` and then left alone forever — it is yours to edit and is
never version-controlled in dotfiles.

Put anything here that should not be shared across machines:

- Paths and tooling that only exist on this box.
- Per-project exemptions from the shared rules in `agents/rules/`.
- Anything about a private or work project.

Secrets and internal team details are a separate concern; those live in
`~/.claude/private/`.
